invariant: INV-63
file: srv_kex.c
catches: tcp_blocking_loop_test
reason: the server selects X25519MLKEM768 for every hello, also for one
  that lists x25519 alone, so its HelloRetryRequest names a group the
  hello did not list. RFC 9846 §4.3.8 requires a group from the client's
  supported_groups. test_reply_extensions sends a hello that lists x25519
  alone and expects a ServerHello for it.

--- old
    if ((ch->groups & SRV_GROUP_X25519MLKEM768) != 0) {
--- new
    if (ch->groups != 0) {
